$ETH 11.17 joker #ETH Evening thought prediction analysis
In fact, it’s still the same as the morning and afternoon, ha, it’s not that I don’t want to help my brothers make money, the market is here 😂 I really have no tricks left. Let’s wait a little longer, we’ve already waited a whole day, so what’s another three or two hours?
Remember the mantra I sent before?
Continuous small rises are true rises; continuous large rises mean to exit;
A significant spike needs to pull back, don’t dig deep pits or buy too much;
A sharp drop with low volume is intimidation; a slow drop with high volume means to withdraw quickly.
